		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Black dragon with red crest. Lurks in dreams, inflicting night terrors on mortals. Often allies with night hags.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +7 (2d8) or 1 nightmare breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Dream Terror</strong>. Enter and change dreams of sleeping creature within far. If a creature dies in a dream under dragon's control, creature dies in real life.</p><p></p><p><strong>Nightmare Breath</strong>. Shadowy, living nightmares fill a double near-sized cube extending from dragon. CON 15+ or 4d6 damage and hallucinate for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. Assume the form of a humanoid.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
